Third-party data
----------------

Files under data/raw/ are redistributed from the Mammalian Methylation
Consortium public release:

    https://github.com/shorvath/MammalianMethylationConsortium
    commit b70331d458b457af9c277b92710e7b79d6d1f889

That material is Copyright (c) 2021 shorvath and is likewise MIT licensed. Its
full licence text is reproduced verbatim in data/raw/UPSTREAM_LICENSE.txt, as
the MIT terms require.

Please cite the original work when using this data:

    Lu AT, Fei Z, Haghani A, et al. Universal DNA methylation age across
    mammalian tissues. Nature Aging 3, 1144-1166 (2023).

    Fei Z, et al. Fundamental equations linking methylation dynamics to
    maximum lifespan in mammals.
